      "Spray-and-wipe format means no rinsing step for everyday crumbs and splashes",
      "Does not require a specialist routine, which keeps care simple for the whole household",
      "Widely stocked, so refills are easy to find"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "A daily cleaner will not lift set-in stains or grease films on its own",
      "Fragranced formulas are a matter of taste; check the label if anyone in the home is scent-sensitive"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "A gentle, stone-labelled spray is all most sintered stone surfaces need day to day. This is the simple, low-risk place to start.",
